1
00:00:00,367 --> 00:00:01,467
June...

2
00:00:01,467 --> 00:00:03,767
[MELANCHOLIC MUSIC PLAYING]

3
00:00:03,767 --> 00:00:06,500
it's true that you're not
your father's true child.

4
00:00:07,767 --> 00:00:11,300
You were still a baby
when he came into my life.

5
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:13,367
Your biological father...

6
00:00:13,567 --> 00:00:16,100
left us and never came back.

7
00:00:16,333 --> 00:00:20,067
But your father fixed
all of the paper works for you

8
00:00:20,267 --> 00:00:22,167
to become his adopted child.

9
00:00:22,367 --> 00:00:24,333
[SHERYN] See? Fake Rose!

10
00:00:25,567 --> 00:00:26,733
But sweetie,

11
00:00:27,133 --> 00:00:30,233
your father's love for you
is not fake.

12
00:00:30,767 --> 00:00:32,467
Always remember that.

13
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:36,100
In his heart, you are truly
his daughter.

14
00:00:36,133 --> 00:00:42,400
[MELANCHOLIC MUSIC CONTINUES]

15
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:43,400
[PING] June!

16
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:44,567
June.

17
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:46,700
What more do you want, Ping?

18
00:00:47,133 --> 00:00:48,667
The truth was laid bare
in front of you.

19
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:51,267
You don't have
to pretend anymore.

20
00:00:58,033 --> 00:00:59,500
You're free at last.

21
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:04,133
You could throw it all away
just like that?

22
00:01:04,767 --> 00:01:06,300
All of it's fake to you?

23
00:01:06,300 --> 00:01:13,267
[SOMBER MUSIC PLAYING]

24
00:01:13,767 --> 00:01:15,233
- June!
- Ping!

25
00:01:15,833 --> 00:01:17,733
Give June some space.

26
00:01:18,133 --> 00:01:21,233
We have to talk about this
as a family first.

27
00:01:26,567 --> 00:01:29,800
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

28
00:01:29,800 --> 00:01:32,567
If you think that you can
finally get the Don's money,

29
00:01:33,100 --> 00:01:34,567
well you're mistaken.

30
00:01:35,133 --> 00:01:37,600
Because his money will go
to the foundation.

31
00:01:38,300 --> 00:01:39,567
Exactly!

32
00:01:39,567 --> 00:01:41,567
To the foundation
where I will be appointed

33
00:01:41,600 --> 00:01:44,067
as the Chairman of the Board.

34
00:01:44,267 --> 00:01:47,600
And the money will be mine!

35
00:01:47,600 --> 00:01:50,433
Ours, Attorney. Don't forget.

36
00:01:51,267 --> 00:01:54,300
You criminals will never win

37
00:01:54,300 --> 00:01:56,800
because Toto has already
revealed everything to me.

38
00:01:57,567 --> 00:02:00,667
[TOTO]<i> I'm sorry, bro.
</i>I'll make it up to you. I swear.

39
00:02:00,667 --> 00:02:02,867
<i> I'll send you all the evidence</i>

40
00:02:02,867 --> 00:02:05,400
<i>that proves that Attorney
and Sheryn bribed me.</i>

41
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:13,833
They are the masterminds

42
00:02:13,867 --> 00:02:16,233
behind the sinking
of Don Nato's yacht.

43
00:02:16,233 --> 00:02:18,333
And attempted murder
towards June.

44
00:02:19,700 --> 00:02:21,333
Seize them!

45
00:02:21,333 --> 00:02:23,400
- What? Where's your evidence?
- Attorney!

46
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:25,300
- What's this?
- Oh my god! [SHRIEKS]

47
00:02:25,300 --> 00:02:26,700
Present the evidence!

48
00:02:26,700 --> 00:02:28,167
Let go of me!

49
00:02:28,167 --> 00:02:29,533
[ZIA] That's not true!

50
00:02:29,533 --> 00:02:36,467
[MOROSE MUSIC PLAYING]
